# Never commit ROMs. Supply your own legally-obtained dump.
integration/*/rom.sfc
integration/*/rom.smc

# vendor/snes9x_libretro.dylib is committed on purpose: it is the little-endian
# rebuild that makes the emulator work at all on Apple Silicon. See
# smwrl/setup_core.py. Regenerate with tools/build_snes9x.sh.

